        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Cut voided silk velvet with metal thread and a warp rib ground.\nDisplayed behind glass. Displayed on its side.\nWarp: yellow silk foundation warp and purple silk pile warp.\nWeft: yellow silk and gilt metal strip.\nPieced: there is a seam along the lower part and the lower section appears to be made from 5 pieces because the pattern is disrupted.\nThere is a metal thread ground with a pattern in purple pile forming a diamond lattice.  Pairs of leaves form the lattice with a solid oval of pile at the junctions.  Each diamond contains an 8-petalled rosette."@en ;
